{"schema": "2.0", "config": {"update_multi": true}, "header": {"title": {"tag": "plain_text", "content": "托管流水｜还等你 1 件"}, "subtitle": {"tag": "plain_text", "content": "11-21 23:30 开始｜更新于 00:40"}, "template": "red"}, "body": {"elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='red'>**还等你 1 件**</font>　往下找红字。每件开头的圆圈数字是它的编号，按冒出来的先后编，回话时带上编号就行。"}, {"tag": "hr"}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "48px", "vertical_align": "top", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>23:30</font>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "vertical_align": "top", "vertical_spacing": "4px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "▶ 托管开始"}]}]}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "48px", "vertical_align": "top", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>23:40</font>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "vertical_align": "top", "vertical_spacing": "4px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>✅ **磁盘瘦身**｜装好了。</font>"}]}]}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "48px", "vertical_align": "top", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>23:55</font>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "vertical_align": "top", "vertical_spacing": "4px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "⚠️ GitHub 连不上，合并先等着。"}]}]}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>—— 11-22 ——</font>", "text_size": "notation"}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "48px", "vertical_align": "top", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>00:20</font>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "vertical_align": "top", "vertical_spacing": "4px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>✅ **数字分身**｜网络恢复，合并办完了。</font>"}]}]}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "48px", "vertical_align": "top", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>00:35</font>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "vertical_align": "top", "vertical_spacing": "4px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "**① 磁盘瘦身 · 第三批整改｜删 2 个用完的工作目录**"}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "留着只占地方。"}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>核对过可以安全删。</font>"}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='red'>**要你做：打开「磁盘瘦身」会话，回「删掉」**</font>"}]}], "margin": "8px 0px 8px 0px"}, {"tag": "hr"}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "**⏳ 正在办，不用你管**\n- **牛马之家 · 界面修复**（首页那几处错位）：改完在自测。"}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>要回话：引用这张单子，写上编号和你的选择，可以一次回完几件。</font>", "text_size": "notation"}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>托管方：Claude 会话「测试」｜单子只有这一张，有进展就在原地更新；只有新冒出要你做的事才另发一句提醒。办完的事是灰字，要你做的是黑字加红字。｜单号 2026-11-21-2330 · 第 1 版</font>", "text_size": "notation"}]}}